# Expected topology: a board the catalog lists but that never comes up (dead
# fuse, unplugged harness at power-on) is a fault the Central reports, not an
# absence nobody notices. When it finally boots it is reported found, and a
# node that was there all along is never reported missing.
at 0.0  power temperature off
at 5.0  expect central event:NODE_MISSING == 1
at 5.0  expect temperature seen == 0
at 5.0  expect stress seen == 1
at 5.0  expect TEMP_CVT valid == 0
at 6.0  power temperature on
at 9.0  expect temperature seen == 1
at 9.0  expect central event:NODE_FOUND >= 1
at 9.0  expect TEMP_CVT age_ms < 1000
at 12.0 expect central event:NODE_MISSING == 1
at 12.0 expect central event:NODE_LOST == 0
at 12.0 expect log intact == 1
end 12.0
